    "1": {
      "note": "Cantonese work vocabulary is built around <em>gung1</em> (工, work). <strong>faan1 gung1</strong> (返工) literally 'return work' = go to work. <strong>fong3 gung1</strong> (放工) literally 'release work' = finish work. <strong>gaa1 baan1</strong> (加班) = overtime. The HK workplace runs on these compounds — you'll hear them daily. <em>tung4 si6</em> (同事, colleague) shares the root <em>tung4</em> (same) you've seen in 'with/and'.",
